  "body": "Step into the vibrant coastal lifestyle that makes Torbay one of Auckland’s most sought-after communities. Embrace the best of coastal living: enjoy leisurely beach walks, take in spectacular sea views, or spend weekends exploring the iconic Long Bay Regional Park, a sanctuary of natural beauty and outdoor adventure.\r\n\r\nSet on a sun-drenched freehold 621m² land (more or less), zoned Mixed Housing Suburban. This three-bedroom, one-bathroom home is designed to cater to both families looking for a low-maintenance lifestyle, and savvy investors or developers seeking long-term value, all in one of Torbay’s most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nThis charming weatherboard residence radiates warmth and character from the moment you arrive. Light pours into the generous open-plan living area, seamlessly flowing to a sunny spacious deck—perfect for morning coffees or evening sunsets. Entertain with ease as the dining area and kitchen invite family and friends to gather. The kitchen is designed for both function and flair, with ample storage and direct access to the private backyard. Down the hallway, you’ll find three inviting bedrooms, each offering space to relax and recharge. The family bathroom and separate laundry add to the effortless, practical layout. Downstairs the single garage plus the extra storage room, and private front yard provide ample space for cars, bikes, and all your toys.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and this address truly delivers. Just a few minutes' stroll brings you to the vibrant Torbay Village, where you’ll find an array of cafés, eateries, and boutique shops. Long Bay Regional Park and beach are only ten minutes on foot, while Waiake Beach is a quick four-minute drive away, and top local schools—including Long Bay College and Torbay School—close at hand, every convenience is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss your opportunity to make this exceptional property yours. Contact us today to arrange a  viewing and experience the lifestyle that awaits.",
